{
  "id": "poem-f9e605a80a881cd63622e0e3",
  "title": "宴桃源・如梦令·天气把人僝僽",
  "author": "黄庭坚",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "天气把人僝僽。",
    "落絮游丝时候。",
    "茶饭可曾忺，镜中赢得销瘦。",
    "生受。",
    "生受。",
    "更被养娘催绣。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.2000.json#record-807",
